     8610     index pi2 mark-parent sts
     8611     index pi3 unit-ext
     8612     index pi4 mark obj-type obj-code gds-code in-code out-code part-code prt-code
     8613     index part gds-code obj-type obj-code in-code out-code part-code prt-code
     8614     index gds-code gds-code
     8615     index obj obj-code obj-type
     8616     .
     8617   define temp-table tt-mark-line like ub.marking-lines
