     9342       substitute ("&1_&2",X_utd.db-num, X_utd.doc-id) @ mdoc-id COLUMN-LABEL "Внутр.!номер" FORMAT "x(12)":U
     9343       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 131 BY 17.63 FIT-LAST-COLUMN.
     9344   DEFINE FRAME d-utd
     9345       b-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1.5
