     9358       F-date-from AT ROW 2.29 COL 28 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 36
     9359       F-sertif AT ROW 2.29 COL 78.5 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 232 NO-TAB-STOP
