     9366       c-status AT ROW 5.08 COL 74.5 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 228
     9367       RADIO-SET-2 AT ROW 5.88 COL 2.5 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 282
     9368       c-status-edi AT ROW 6.13 COL 74.5 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 248
