    10633           OPEN QUERY br-utd FOR EACH X_utd NO-LOCK by X_utd.DocumentDate desc by X_utd.Timestamp desc INDEXED-REPOSITION.
    10634       END.
    10635   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF c-type IN FRAME d-utd
    10636       DO:
    10637           assign c-type .
